 the swaps increase the market availability of financial instruments hedged in U.S. dollars. Typically, the swap auctions lead to a weakening of the U.S. dollar and a strengthening of the Brazilian real.\par \par \uc2 The real strengthened to BRL2.1629 per dollar in after-hours trading in the wake of the auction, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had exited active trading at BRL2.1734 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Write to Jeff Fick at jeff.fick@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 17, 2013 16:20 ET (20:20 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130617e96h004xc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw145\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2175\pichgoal600
