\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil's Real Closes at Weakest Level Vs. Dollar in 2013\b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 2013\par 22:13\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO--Brazil's real ended at its weakest point so far this year against the dollar on Tuesday, as the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose across the board on the back of data that showed Americans are the most confident they have been about economic prospects in five years.\par \par \uc2 The ICE dollar index, which measures the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's movement against six other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , rose to 84.218 from 83.700.\par \par \uc2 In \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 , investors were speculating whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to shore up the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Some officials and economists have expressed concern that a rapidly depreciating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could harm efforts to tame inflation.\par \par \uc2 "We enter in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  territory above 2.0700," one trader said in a note.\par \par \uc2 After weakening sharply in the middle of the session, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  settled in a range around BRL2.0650 to BRL2.070. At 3:59 p.m. EDT, the real was trading at BRL2.0718, weaker than Monday's close of BRL2.0531, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , meanwhile, began its two-day monetary-policy meeting, amid near-unanimous agreement that the key interest rate, Selic, will be raised as part of the effort to control prices. Investors, however, are divided over whether the \b \highlight2