\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil's Real Closes Slightly Weaker on Flows\b0\par\par\uc2 290 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2013\par 20:17\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 By Jeffrey T. Lewis\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO--The Brazilian real closed slightly weaker against the dollar on Wednesday as cash flows determined direction on a day with little news to move the market.\par \par \uc2 The real exited active trading at BRL1.9693 to the dollar, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet, from 1.9607 at Tuesday's close.\par \par \uc2 "It looks like there was a biggish movement outwards in the afternoon, some company closing a deal or something, and that strengthened the dollar," said Wanderlei Muniz, a trader at the Onnix brokerage in Porto Alegre. "There was a lot of money coming in earlier, the trend was for the real to strengthen, then there was probably that deal."\par \par \uc2 Markets are wondering if and when \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again, and what the bank's next move on interest rates will be.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president, \uc2 Alexandre Tombini\uc2 , said Tuesday in Poland that Brazil's growth is resuming, but inflation has remained "resilient" in the last few months.\par \par \uc2 In his presentation, Mr. Tombini reiterated that Brazil's flexible exchange rate helps buffer economy from global shocks.\par \par \uc2 On Monday, the real traded close to BRL1.94 to the dollar. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  with a so-called reverse-swap auction. In such auctions the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases U.S. dollar futures.\par \par \uc2 "The market is moving cautiously," said Reginaldo Galhardo, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at Brazil's brokerage Treviso. "Investors are waiting to see if \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will decide to raise interest rates in the next meeting," he added.\par \par \uc2 -Luciana Magalhaes in Sao Paulo contributed to this article.\par \par \uc2 Write to Jeffrey T. Lewis at jeffrey.lewis@dowjones.com [ 13-03-13 1917GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130313e93d000tm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
