\par\par \b \uc2 Brazilian Real Notches Strongest Close Since May 10\b0\par\par\uc2 431 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Februar 2013\par 20:46\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --Brazil's real exits active trading at BRL1.9577 to the dollar\par \par \uc2 --Strongest close for local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since May 10\par \par \uc2 --Market is "testing" \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's tolerance for real strength amid inflation worries\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Paul Kiernan \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 RIO DE JANEIRO--Brazil's real posted its strongest close against the greenback since May 10 on Thursday, as investors tested local authorities' willingness to accept a stronger \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in light of rising local inflation.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The real exited active trading at BRL1.9577 to the dollar, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet, compared with BRL1.9642 at Wednesday's close.\f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  with a reverse-swap auction to stem a rally by the real Friday, remained on the sidelines.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The market is testing the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  again, but it was a slower, calmer move," B&T Associados trading chief Marcos Trabbold said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The real's appreciation Thursday ran contrary to the predominant trend in international markets, as stocks and other \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  such as the euro and Mexican peso lost value amid weak economic data from the troubled euro zone.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Analysts increasingly believe Brazilian authorities--who last year actively promoted a weaker real amid a recession in local industry--are prepared to allow some \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  appreciation in order to help rein in inflation.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "In Brazil, which led the charge in the global \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  wars just two years ago, priorities are shifting," the Eurasia Group said in a report, noting the government's presumed desire to preserve record-low interest rates. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  "is silently pushing for a stronger \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Sidnei Nehme, director of Sao Paulo's NGO trading house, said Brazilian banks are "extremely short" dollars, heeding the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's perceived desire for a stronger \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rather than market fundamentals.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "We've got negative \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  flows persisting in Brazil since December," Mr. Nehme said. Banks are betting on a stronger real on the expectation that Brazil's foreign-trade deficit so far this year will reverse itself and that reduced capital controls will start attracting more foreign money to the country, he said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 But participants in the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market soon will have to repay the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  for several billion dollars in credit lines that expire in coming weeks, unless the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rolls them over.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "We're going to have some pressure in the market at some point because the banks will have to deliver dollars to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," Mr. Nehme said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Paul Kiernan at paul.kiernan@dowjones.com [ 14-02-13 1946GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130214e92e000zd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
