\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil currency \highlight\uc2  set to gain as cenbank warns of  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 310 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Dezember 2012\par 20:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Cenbank conducting survey go gauge demand for dollars\par \par \uc2 * Real gains in futures market after announcement\par \par \uc2 (Adds market impact, background, byline)\par \par \uc2 By Walter Brandimarte\par \par \uc2 RIO DE JANEIRO, Dec 7 (Reuters) - The Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was set to strengthen early next week after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  warned late on Friday it was conducting a survey to gauge demand for dollars in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 The real ended 0.6 percent weaker at 2.0904 per dollar on Friday, interrupting a string of four winning sessions that had been spurred by a series of government measures designed to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Right after the market closed, however, a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman said the bank was in touch with \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  desks at key banks in Brazil to gauge demand for traditional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps -- derivatives that emulate the sale of dollars in the future market -- and for dollar sales with repurchase agreement.\par \par \uc2 Those were exactly the tools the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  used on Monday when it acted to halt a slide that had taken the real to its weakest level in more than 3-1/2 years.\par \par \uc2 Although Brazil's spot \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was closed when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  started its survey, dollar futures contracts moved sharply at the BM&FBovespa.\par \par \uc2 The contract for January 2013, the most liquid at the exchange, showed the real strengthening to 2.082 per dollar from 2.098 reais per dollar minutes before the announcement.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will announce its swap or dollar auctions through its regular messaging system if it finds demand for them, the bank's spokesman said.\par \par \uc2 (Additional reporting by Patricia Duarte in Sao Paulo; editing by Andrew Hay)\par \par \uc2 BRAZIL-REAL/CENBANK (UPDATE 1) | ABN | D | E | RBN | M | NAT | U | C | O | MTL | GRO | SOF | OIL | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020121207e8c700165\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
